{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_4610ae9d8246190f211a4fe3b60351beaba3b0fe05a1131e3826a1913279453e", "title": "Pasha Kovalev", "text": "Pavel \"Pasha\" Kovalev (Russian: Па́вел \"Па́ша\" Ковалёв ; born 19 January 1980) is a Russian professional latin and ballroom dancer.", "score": 56.4264}, {"id": "hp_doc_7efcf8e095a98915c763979d30038b5769515677ad1fdd87f728935fc218de57", "title": "Lindsay Arnold", "text": "Lindsay Arnold Cusick (born January 11, 1994) is an American professional Latin and ballroom dancer. She was a contestant on \"So You Think You Can Dance\". She is a professional dancer and choreographer on \"Dancing with the Stars\".", "score": 35.8638}, {"id": "hp_doc_6df59c61f7bae4959e3c1d2ed9b68708c05e0c9683f3f3ae5355c71695fcdc3d", "title": "Oti Mabuse", "text": "Otlile \"Oti\" Mabuse (born 8 August 1990) is a South African professional Latin American and ballroom dancer. She is best known as a professional dancer on the British TV series, \"Strictly Come Dancing\", and its German equivalent, \"Let's Dance\".", "score": 31.8321}], "remaining_searches": 2}
