{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_843f5eef50a89e03a5fce0b45f0bb54b51d1ba02632eb37e7a27cb5f33244d6d", "title": "Meghann Fahy", "text": "Meghann Alexandra Fahy (born April 25, 1990) is an American actress and singer, best known for her role as Natalie Goodman in the play \"Next to Normal\", and as Hannah O'Connor on the ABC daytime soap opera \"One Life to Live\".", "score": 24.9214}, {"id": "hp_doc_273bee7e64cba926b1f50037f1dff5024b020c8df08b00bccaffa658b598c2e4", "title": "Those People", "text": "Those People is a 2015 American drama film, written and directed by Joey Kuhn . The film stars Jonathan Gordon, Jason Ralph and Haaz Sleiman. The cast also includes Britt Lower, Meghann Fahy, Chris Conroy and Allison Mackie.", "score": 19.9326}, {"id": "hp_doc_b2d148d675099d3bcb597d056babd2959d6c164c9bedc322d77f4b329ddfc39b", "title": "The Bold Type", "text": "The Bold Type is an American drama television series created by Sarah Watson, starring Katie Stevens, Aisha Dee, and Meghann Fahy. It is inspired by the life of former \"Cosmopolitan\" editor-in-chief Joanna Coles. The series officially premiered with a two-hour episode on Freeform on July 11, 2017, after the pilot episode was aired in a special preview on June 20, 2017.", "score": 16.8637}], "remaining_searches": 2}
